##### Authentication and User Management
### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "exampleuser",
  "email": "exampleuser@email.com",
  "password": "Teste123!@",
  "first_name": "example",
  "last_name": "user"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "exampleuser",
  "password": "Teste123!@"
}

### Refresh token (set {{refresh}} from login response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refresh}}"
}

### Me (set {{access}} from login response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Update profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/update-profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "example_updated",
  "last_name": "user_updated",
  "email": "exampleupdateduser@email.com"
}

### Change password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "Teste123!@",
  "new_password": "Teste123!@"
}


##### Objectives
### Objective types
GET {{baseUrl}}/objectives/types/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Create objective (goal calendar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/objectives/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objective_type": "GOAL_CALENDAR",
  "goal_calendar": "{{goalCalendarId}}",
  "title": "Sprint week 1",
  "description": "Entregar backlog da semana"
}

### Create objective (LONG_TERM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/objectives/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objective_type": "LONG_TERM",
  "title": "Long term objective",
  "description": "This is a long term objective"
}

### Create objective (MEDIUM_TERM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/objectives/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objective_type": "MEDIUM_TERM",
  "title": "Medium term objective",
  "description": "This is a medium term objective "
}

### List objectives by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/objectives/type/LONG_TERM/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### List objectives by goal calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/objectives/goal-calendar/{{goalCalendarId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Objective detail (set {{objectiveId}} from create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/objectives/{{objectiveId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Complete objective
POST {{baseUrl}}/objectives/{{objectiveId}}/complete/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}


##### Goal Calendars
### Create goal calendar
POST {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Roadmap",
  "num_weeks": 6,
  "start_date": "2026-02-10"
}

### List goal calendars
GET {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Goal calendar detail (set {{goalCalendarId}} from create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/{{goalCalendarId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Update goal calendar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/{{goalCalendarId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Roadmap updated",
  "num_weeks": 6,
  "start_date": "2026-02-04"
}

### Delete goal calendar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/{{goalCalendarId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}


##### Goal Calendar Weeks
### List active weeks for a goal calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/{{goalCalendarId}}/weeks/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Activity metric types
GET {{baseUrl}}/goal-calendars/activities/metric-types/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}



